{{!
    @template mod_booking/bookingoption_description_bookedslots

    The slots a user currently holds on a slot booking booking option.

    Slot options have no optiondates at all - the booked slots live as ranges inside the user's
    booking answer - so the neighbouring "dates" partial is always empty for them. Without this the
    option page showed a bare "Booked" and never said WHICH slots that meant, and once
    max_slots_per_user was used up the slot picker stopped opening, so there was no way left to
    find out.

    Rendered from bookingoption_description, and scoped to the user that description is rendered
    FOR - which is not necessarily the logged in user.

    When slotreleaseenabled is set (self-service only: the viewing user IS the booked user, the
    option opts into self-rebooking and the cancellation policy allows it - see
    slot_mover::per_slot_release_available()) each still-cancelable row carries a cancel button
    that releases exactly that slot via the release_slots webservice
    (mod_booking/slotbooking/slot_release). Rows past their relative deadline stay read-only.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * bookedslotsexist - Whether the user holds any booked slot on this option. Nothing renders
      when this is falsy.
    * slotreleaseenabled - Whether per-slot cancel buttons are offered.
    * bookedslots - The booked slots, ordered by start time.
        * daylabel - Localised day, e.g. "Friday, 4 September 2026".
        * timelabel - Localised time range, e.g. "9:20 AM - 10:00 AM".
        * optionid, baid, key - Address of this slot for the release webservice.
        * cancelable - Whether this slot is still before its release deadline.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "bookedslotsexist": true,
        "slotreleaseenabled": true,
        "bookedslots": [
            {"daylabel": "Friday, 4 September 2026", "timelabel": "9:20 AM - 10:00 AM",
             "optionid": 5140, "baid": 2229, "key": "1788852000:1788854400", "cancelable": true},
            {"daylabel": "Wednesday, 9 September 2026", "timelabel": "10:00 AM - 10:40 AM",
             "optionid": 5140, "baid": 2229, "key": "1789286400:1789288800", "cancelable": false}
        ]
    }
}}
{{#bookedslotsexist}}
    <div class="bo_bookedslots list-group-item border-0 ps-0 pe-0">
        <div class="booking-showdates-title">
            <i class="fa fa-calendar fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i>&nbsp;<b>{{#str}}slot_report_numslots, mod_booking{{/str}}</b>
        </div>
        <div class="list-group">
            {{#bookedslots}}
                <div class="list-group-item bo_bookedslot d-flex align-items-center flex-wrap gap-2">
                    <b class="bo_bookedslot_day">{{daylabel}}</b>
                    <span class="bo_bookedslot_time">{{timelabel}}</span>
                    {{#slotreleaseenabled}}
                        {{#cancelable}}
                            <button type="button"
                                    class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger icon-no-margin ms-auto booking-slot-release"
                                    data-action="booking-slot-release"
                                    data-optionid="{{optionid}}"
                                    data-baid="{{baid}}"
                                    data-slotkey="{{key}}"
                                    data-slotlabel="{{daylabel}}, {{timelabel}}"
                                    aria-label="{{#str}}slot_release_action, mod_booking{{/str}}"
                                    title="{{#str}}slot_release_action, mod_booking{{/str}}">
                                {{#pix}}t/delete, core{{/pix}}
                            </button>
                        {{/cancelable}}
                    {{/slotreleaseenabled}}
                </div>
            {{/bookedslots}}
        </div>
    </div>
    {{#slotreleaseenabled}}
        {{#js}}
            require(['mod_booking/slotbooking/slot_release'], function(module) {
                module.init();
            });
        {{/js}}
    {{/slotreleaseenabled}}
{{/bookedslotsexist}}
